@startuml
[*] --> Idle : Initial State
Idle -->|User selects a predefined amount|> SelectingAmount : Select Predefined Amount
SelectingAmount -->|User inputs a custom withdrawal amount|> InputtingCustomAmount : Input Custom Amount
SelectingAmount --> Cancelled : Cancel Transaction
InputtingCustomAmount -->|Transaction completed successfully|> Completed : Complete Transaction
InputtingCustomAmount --> Cancelled : Cancel Transaction

Completed --> [*] : Final State
Cancelled --> [*] : Cancelled Transaction
@enduml
